msgid ""
"This graph would contain at least {people_count} people, which exceeds the "
"limit of {people_limit} people. For performance reasons, at least "
"{people_missing} people won't be shown. You can change this limit in the "
"view configuration."
msgstr ""
"Denna graf skulle innehålla minst {people_count} personer, vilket "
"överskrider gränsen på {people_limit} personer. Av prestandaskäl kommer "
"minst {people_missing} personer inte att visas. Du kan ändra denna gräns i "
"vykonfigurationen."

